@startuml
title CFS-based delivery

participant "ProductOrderOrchestration\nManagement" as POOM
participant "ProductOrderCapture\nValidation" as POCV
participant "ProductInventory" as PI
participant "ServiceOrdering\nManagement" as SOM
participant "EventManagement" as Event

Event -> SOM : 40 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /serviceOrderStateChangeEvent\n(serviceOrderItem#1 - state="completed")

SOM --> POOM : 41 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /listener/serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItem#1 - state="completed")
activate POOM

POOM -> POOM : 42 update delivery flow

POOM -> PI : 43 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management** PATCH /product/id1\n(state update to active)
activate PI
PI --> POOM : 44 **TMF637** 200 OK\nProduct updated
deactivate PI

POOM -> POCV : 45 **TMF622 Product Ordering** PATCH /productOrder\n(state item update to completed)
activate POCV
POCV --> POOM : 46 **TMF622** 200 OK\nProductOrder updated
deactivate POCV

POOM -> Event : 47 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /productOrderStateChangeEvent\n(productOrderItem#1 - state="completed")

alt if all PrdOrdCptVd item delivered
    POOM -> Event : 48 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /processFlowStateChangeEvent\n(state='Completed',PFSpec='POOM')
end

deactivate POOM

@enduml
